\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
 from LF through to SHF. It transmits narrow band signals using low power in two-minute timeslots. Receiving stations then decode the transmissions and upload them to the Internet and the results are made available for anyone to download. WSPR Scheduler w
\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 as\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
 developed to enable the scheduling of these transmissions and to allow seamless band and antenna switching. It also decodes received signals and uploads them to the Internet. A separate app (WSPR Scheduler Live) downloads reported transmission from the I
